    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d283">

                <pb facs="0411" n="329" xml:id="pg329"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/3721: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Houghton</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-05-18T16:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1925—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 18—10:58 (?)
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>148. Department’s number 154, dated May 16, 4 p.m. Foreign Office has assured me
                    that it will issue proper instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Houghton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
